    card title "Where do you live?"

A: How do you say where you live in Russian? I'm Tom, and I live here, in London.
    draw c_lon tom

B: And I live here, in Moscow. In Russian: я живу́ в Москве́.
    draw c_mos masha g_open

A: Two things are new here: the verb, живу́, I live, and the е on the end of Москве́.
    blocking false

    pause 0.6

    highlight g_open_w_2 color #c9871a effect underline

    pause 2.4

    highlight g_open_w_4 color #c9871a part е effect circle

    hide c_lon c_mos tom masha g_open

    draw inf inf_ar f_ya_top

A: The verb is жить, to live, but in я жив (@highlight f_ya_top color #c9871a part в effect circle@)у́, I live, a в appears that жить doesn't have.

    draw f_ya g_ya f_ty g_ty f_on g_on parallel true

B: Every form keeps the в, and only the ending, in green, changes: я живу́, ты живёшь, он живёт.
    blocking false

    highlight f_ya color #c9871a part в effect circle

    pause 0.5

    highlight f_ty color #c9871a part в effect circle

    pause 0.5

    highlight f_on color #c9871a part в effect circle

    pause 0.5

A: These are lesson twenty-two's endings, as in чита́ю, чита́ешь: у where чита́ю has ю, and ё where the stress falls on the ending.
    blocking false

    pause 0.8

    highlight f_ya color #c9871a part у$ effect underline

    pause 2.6

    highlight f_ty color #c9871a part ёшь$ effect underline

    erase verb_top inf_ar

B: For more than one: мы живём, вы живёте, они́ живу́т.
    draw f_my g_my f_vy g_vy f_oni g_oni

A: So to ask a friend: где ты живёшь? And to someone you call вы: где вы живёте?
    highlight f_ty f_vy color #c9871a

    erase verb_rows

    show c_lon c_mos tom masha

    draw c_osl c_ber parallel true

B: Now the place. Москва́ ends in а, but after  (@draw v_mos@)в, the а makes way for е: в Москве́.

A: It's lesson nine's е, from в рестора́не and на столе́: city names take it too.
    highlight v_mos color #c9871a part е$ effect underline

A: Ло́ндон ends in a consonant, so it simply adds е: я живу́ в Ло́ндоне.
    draw v_lon

B: Берли́н does the same: в Берли́не.
    draw v_ber

A: But О́сло never changes: в О́сло.
    draw v_osl

A: It's a foreign name in о, and like ко́фе, it stays as it is.
    highlight v_osl color #c9871a part О́сло effect underline

B: Many countries end in ия, like Росси́я, Russia.
    draw k_rus

    hide k_rus

B: After в, the я becomes и: в Росси́и.
    draw w_rus

A: А́нглия is England, and Норве́гия is Norway.
    draw k_eng k_nor parallel true

    hide k_eng k_nor

A: So: в А́нглии, в Норве́гии.
    draw w_eng w_nor

B: A country in ия ends in two и's after в, never in е.
    blocking false

    highlight w_eng color #c9871a part ии$ effect underline

    pause 0.7

    highlight w_nor color #c9871a part ии$ effect underline

    pause 0.7

    highlight w_rus color #c9871a part ии$ effect underline

    pause 0.7

    hide c_lon c_osl c_ber c_mos d_lon d_osl d_ber d_mos v_lon v_osl v_ber v_mos w_rus w_eng w_nor tom masha

B: Now I ask Tom where he lives, and he asks about my brother, Ива́н.
    show speakers

    dialogue talk speakers.a tom_d speakers.b masha_d turns [{"by":"b","text":"Том, где ты живёшь?","gloss":"Tom, where do you live?"},{"by":"a","text":"Я живу́ в Ло́ндоне, в А́нглии. А ты?","gloss":"I live in London, in England. And you?"},{"by":"b","text":"Я живу́ в Москве́.","gloss":"I live in Moscow."},{"by":"a","text":"А Ива́н? Где он живёт?","gloss":"And Ivan? Where does he live?"},{"by":"b","text":"Он живёт в О́сло, в Норве́гии.","gloss":"He lives in Oslo, in Norway."}] size 1.25

    draw talk

    draw talk

    erase talk_1

    draw talk

    draw talk

A: Ива́н lives in О́сло, but Norway takes its ии: в Норве́гии.
    highlight talk_5_words color #c9871a part Норве́гии effect underline

    erase talk

    hide speakers

    quiz "Masha lives in Moscow: Я живу́ в … Which form fills the gap?" store q1 reveal.text "Я живу́ в Москве́." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 380 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        intro: Five questions now, then your score.
        right: After в, Москва́ swaps its а for е.
        wrong: Москву́ is the form after ви́жу; after в, the place takes lesson nine's ending.
        * Москва́
        + Москве́
        * Москву́

    icon q_city size 130 set twemoji x 500 y 560 or ["city sunset","classical building"] icon_look picture of cityscape

    pause 1.2

    erase q_city q1_stamp

    ask "Ask Tom where he lives: Где ты …? Type the verb." answer ["живёшь","живешь"] reveal.text "Где ты живёшь?" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 380 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        keys: АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЪЫЬЭЮЯ
        right: Где ты живёшь? Where do you live?
        wrong: The ты form: it ends like чита́ешь, with ё.

    icon q_tom size 130 set twemoji x 500 y 560 or ["person"] icon_look picture of man

    pause 1.2

    erase q_tom question_2_stamp

    quiz "Ivan lives in Norway: Ива́н живёт в … Which form?" store q3 reveal.text "Ива́н живёт в Норве́гии." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 380 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        right: A country in ия ends in ии after в.
        wrong: Норве́гия ends in ия, so not е.
        * Норве́гия
        * Норве́гие
        + Норве́гии

    icon q_nor size 130 set twemoji x 500 y 560 or ["Norway","snow-capped mountain"] icon_look picture of "flag: Norway"

    pause 1.2

    erase q_nor q3_stamp

    quiz "Mum and dad live in Berlin: Ма́ма и па́па … в Берли́не. Which form?" store q4 reveal.text "живу́т в Берли́не" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 380 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: Mum and dad are они́, so живу́т: ма́ма и па́па живу́т в Берли́не.
        wrong: Two people: who are they, он, мы or они́?
        + живу́т
        * живёт
        * живём

    icon q_fam1 size 120 set twemoji x 440 y 560 or ["person"] icon_look picture of woman
    icon q_fam2 size 120 set twemoji x 560 y 560 or ["person"] icon_look picture of man
    parallel true

    pause 1.2

    erase q_fam1 q_fam2 q4_stamp

    ask "A new city: Rome is Рим. Type in Rome." answer ["в Риме"] reveal.text "в Ри́ме" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 380 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        keys "АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЪЫЬЭЮЯ "
        right: Рим ends in a consonant, so it adds е, like Берли́н: в Ри́ме.
        wrong: Two words: в, then Рим with lesson nine's ending.

    icon q_rome size 130 set twemoji x 500 y 560 or ["stadium"] icon_look picture of "classical building"

    pause 1.2

    erase q_rome question_5_stamp

    show d_lon d_osl d_ber d_mos v_lon v_osl v_ber v_mos w_rus w_eng w_nor tom masha

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

A: So to say where you live: живу́, with its в, then в and the place with е, or ии for a country in ия.
    highlight v_lon v_ber v_mos w_rus w_eng w_nor color #c9871a

B: А я живу́ в Москве́, в Росси́и. А вы? Где вы живёте? Пока́!
    highlight masha v_mos color #c9871a

